// Remix of "$$$ Royal - Mashup (197)" by projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop.
// Source: https://github.com/projectM-visualizer/presets-cream-of-the-crop
// Remix changes: calibrated dynamics, runtime-generated coordinated palettes, white-hot
// impact cores, bounded micro-particles, and the original coherent arc geometry.
// q1 shape clock; q2 source-valid gate; q3 energy; q4 hard spike; q5 impact;
// q6 level; q7 zoom; q8 activity; q9-q17 accent RGB; q18 white-core energy;
// q19 ambient-particle alpha; q20 action-spark envelope; q21-q23 primary RGB;
// q24 latched loud-section level. b3n is a temporary RMS input, restored to zero.
// Original preset author attribution is retained through the source filename.
MILKDROP_PRESET_VERSION=201
PSVERSION=2
PSVERSION_WARP=2
PSVERSION_COMP=2
